{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はおにぃちゃんのサッカーの初蹴りを見に行きました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに見れて楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆優しい方達ばかりで、\n沢山の方が『応援してるよ』とか言ってくれて嬉かっです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆のおうどん作ったりした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁ箸を配ったり渡したりする担当が多かったけど♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さい子も来てて、まあやが恥ずかしくて声をかけにくいな〜って思ってたら、\n小さい子の方から手招きしてくれて...照\nもう可愛くて可愛くて楽しかった〜♪"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今ちーちゃん(斎籐ちはるちゃん)から連絡きて、まあやたちの家族の写メみて『かわいー』\nってただそれだけを伝えに連絡をくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉嬉嬉"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとーにいつも面倒見てくれるお姉ちゃんで『まあやまあや』\nっていってくれるんだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやもそんなちはるんが大好きなのー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"←ちはるんって感じ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"【字】綺麗だからぴったり"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山のコメント\n本当にいつもありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎回読むのが楽しみで、ワクワクとドキッ♪って感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会も行くよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれてて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしてますので、風邪引かないで下さいね〜o(^o^)o"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"少しだけ質問返しを..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ダイエットをしてるとしたら、どんな事をしてるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは全然してないよ〜笑\n元気が一番!!\n最近の好きな食べ物は、クレープ\n以前はお肉が食べれなかったけど、最近\nお肉が好きになりました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"★ずっと気になってたコメントがあって...なんて伝えたらいいかわからなくて\n答えられなかったんだけど...\n確か、学校に行きにくくて、どうやって乗り越えたのか...みたいなコメントだったんだけど..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは転校生だし、お仕事で休む事もあるから...\nまあやがこのクラスにいるんだって普通に思ってもらえるようになるように毎日頑張って学校に行こう！って思ったり、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやだけじゃない、皆お仕事や学校やバイトとか...病気とか...\nみんな頑張ってるんだ、１人じゃないんだ！って思って頑張って行ってたら\nお友だちができたの\n悩みを誰かに相談できる迄はしんどいけど、誰かに少しだけ話を聞いてもらうと\n気持ちが楽になる\nまあやでよかったらまたコメント待ってるよ〜\n１人じゃないよ!!\n一緒に頑張ろう!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"以上です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回の質問で\n個別の服の事ですが、可愛い系が多かったでね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみにしててね〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/02/3672854/0009.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}